// changed for THEM, in one line each. Add a block here when releasing.
// Each release is broken into themed groups; one group = one slide in the
// WhatsNewModal, so a big update reads like the onboarding (a few tidy screens)
// instead of a wall of 30+ bullets. Older/auto entries may still use a flat
// `items` array — the modal chunks those into slides itself.
